WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two moments can arrive close together. Detecting the first
does not guarantee reporting the second.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In an attention experiment, targets appear in a
rapid visual stream among distractions.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
When distractors intervene, the second target
may be reported less often.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Yet immediate targets can be spared.
Sequence and timing matter.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Meditation research asks interesting questions,
but it did not test this consumer audio.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check the independent source. Then ask what
the offer actually contains before buying.
